# Design examples only. Set baseUrl, systemAdminToken, tenantAdminToken, tenantId in your local secret environment.
# Do not commit real tokens. Execute against staging only after backend implementation.

### Published theme: tenant selected from authenticated session
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/tenant/theme
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantAdminToken}}

### System Admin reads current draft + ETag
GET {{baseUrl}}/system/tenants/{{tenantId}}/theme/draft
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}

### Negative: Tenant Admin must receive403 and no mutation
POST {{baseUrl}}/system/tenants/{{tenantId}}/theme/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: qa-negative-review-0001

{"draftRevision":1,"baseVersion":1}

### Review exact saved draft revision
POST {{baseUrl}}/system/tenants/{{tenantId}}/theme/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: qa-review-draft-0001

{"draftRevision":1,"baseVersion":1}

### Publish: copy returned review token and confirmed baseVersion
POST {{baseUrl}}/system/tenants/{{tenantId}}/theme/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: qa-publish-draft-0001

{"reviewToken":"{{reviewToken}}","baseVersion":1}

### Rollback review: append new version after confirmation; never overwrite history
POST {{baseUrl}}/system/tenants/{{tenantId}}/theme/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: qa-review-rollback-0001

{"sourceVersion":1,"baseVersion":2,"reason":"Khôi phục cấu hình theo ca kiểm thử có phê duyệt"}
